#: ktrash.cpp:30
msgid "Empty the contents of the trash"
msgstr "Çüplek eçtälegen buşat"

#: ktrash.cpp:32
msgid "Restore a trashed file to its original location"
msgstr "Taşlanğan biremne çığanaq urınlaşuında torğız"

#: ktrash.cpp:34
msgid "Ignored"
msgstr "Qaralmí qalğan"

#: ktrash.cpp:42
msgid "ktrash"
msgstr "ktrash"

#: ktrash.cpp:43
msgid ""
"Helper program to handle the KDE trash can\n"
"Note: to move files to the trash, do not use ktrash, but \"kfmclient move 'url' "
"trash:/\""
msgstr ""
"KDE çüplege belän eşläw öçen yärdämçe yazılım\n"
"Belderü: biremne çüplekkä küçerü öçen ktrash qullanası tügel, bolay itäse: "
"\"kfmclient move 'url' trash:/\""

#: kio_trash.cpp:46
msgid "Protocol name"
msgstr "Protokol adı"

#: kio_trash.cpp:47 kio_trash.cpp:48
msgid "Socket name"
msgstr "Soket adı"

#: kio_trash.cpp:97 kio_trash.cpp:160 kio_trash.cpp:317 kio_trash.cpp:349
#: kio_trash.cpp:507 kio_trash.cpp:519
#, c-format
msgid "Malformed URL %1"
msgstr "Bozıqtözeşle URL %1"

#: kio_trash.cpp:116
msgid ""
"The directory %1 does not exist anymore, so it is not possible to restore this "
"item to its original location. You can either recreate that directory and use "
"the restore operation again, or drag the item anywhere else to restore it."
msgstr ""
"%1 digän törgäk bütän barlıqta yuq, şuña kürä bu keremne üz urınlaşuında "
"torğızıp bulmí. Şul törgäkne qabat yasağaç, ul keremen tağın torğızıp qararğa "
"bula, yä ki başqa törgäkkä österep küçerergä."

#: kio_trash.cpp:145
msgid "This file is already in the trash bin."
msgstr "Bu birem çüplektä yata inde."

